  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> for the reaction&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#8652;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;(Nearest integer)</p><p>Given:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>54</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>07</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>JK</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>(Taken&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>298</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5705</mn></math> )</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We can use the relationship between the equilibrium constant (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>) and the standard Gibbs free energy change (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;G</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></math>) to calculate the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>54</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>07</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8710;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>JK</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>We know,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>54</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>07</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>298</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>1000</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>57</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>05</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mole</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mi>RT</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>logK</mi><mtext>eq&#160;</mtext></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>57</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>05</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>logK</mi><mtext>eq&#160;</mtext></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>57</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>05</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5705</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>logK</mi><mtext>eq&#160;</mtext></msub></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
